§ `s 7 -- am I old enough (c025: Chloe turns 18 on 14 March 2021)`

#ASSERT `age in completed years` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 13 3 2021) EQUALS 17

#ASSERT NOT `Am I old enough to make a valid will` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 13 3 2021) FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I old enough to make a valid will` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 14 3 2021) FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I old enough to make a valid will` (Date 14 3 2003) (Date 1 1 2019) TRUE

§ `s 6 -- what my will may do (d085: Daniel's will with a testamentary trust)`

#ASSERT `May my will make this provision` `a gift on trust of property I own when I die`
#ASSERT `May my will make this provision` `a guardian for my infant child`
#ASSERT NOT `May my will make this provision` `a gift of property I am not entitled to when I die`

