#ASSERT `Is my will signed and witnessed as section 8 requires` `the same, where a witness takes a gift`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my will signed and witnessed as section 8 requires` `witnessed by one`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my will signed and witnessed as section 8 requires` `two witnesses, one unable to see`
#ASSERT `Is my will signed and witnessed as section 8 requires` `three witnesses, one unable to see`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my will signed and witnessed as section 8 requires` `an unsigned typed will`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my will signed and witnessed as section 8 requires` `witnesses who signed after I left the room`

