§ `ss 32, 33 -- informal documents`

#ASSERT `Can my informal document be my will` FALSE (Date 20 10 2026) TRUE EQUALS `not while I am living: s 32 applies only to the document of a deceased person`
#ASSERT `Can my informal document be my will` TRUE (Date 2 11 2088) TRUE EQUALS `it is my will, because the Supreme Court is satisfied I intended it to be (s 32)`
#ASSERT `Can my informal document be my will` TRUE (Date 8 2 2008) TRUE EQUALS `not a will: s 33 confines s 32 to deaths on or after 9 February 2008`
#ASSERT `Can my informal document be my will` TRUE (Date 9 2 2008) TRUE EQUALS `it is my will, because the Supreme Court is satisfied I intended it to be (s 32)`

