#ASSERT `Is my revoked will revived` FALSE TRUE

§ `ss 26, 27 -- a beneficiary who dies first (k084, c087: everything to Sue; c098: Chloe's children equally)`

#ASSERT `What becomes of the gift in my will` `everything to the spouse, who survives` EQUALS `the gift takes effect`
#ASSERT `What becomes of the gift in my will` `everything to the spouse, who dies first` EQUALS `it is not disposed of by the will`
#ASSERT `What becomes of the gift in my will` `half the estate to a child who survives` EQUALS `the gift takes effect`
#ASSERT `What becomes of the gift in my will` `half the estate to a child who died first leaving a child` EQUALS `it passes to the beneficiary's children who survive, in equal shares`
#ASSERT `What becomes of the gift in my will` `half the estate to a childless child who died first` EQUALS `the share accrues to the other shares`
#ASSERT `What becomes of the gift in my will` `a legacy to a friend who died first, with a residue clause` EQUALS `the gift falls into the residue`
#ASSERT `What becomes of the gift in my will` `half to a child who died first leaving a child, the will saying otherwise` EQUALS `as the will itself provides`

#ASSERT NOT `Do the beneficiary's children take the gift under section 27` `a gift to a child as joint tenant, who died first leaving a child`
#ASSERT `Do the beneficiary's children take the gift under section 27` `half the estate to a child who died first leaving a child`

-- k084: Jake, left out of his father's will, asks whether this Act gives him anything.
#ASSERT NOT `Does this Act give me a share the will does not` TRUE

